  "title": "Grilled Cod",
  "description": "Grilled cod with a Cajun spice rub is basted with lemon-butter sauce as it cooks over hot coals on the grill. Perfect for a simple but tasty summer meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenny Crocker"
  ],
